              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ubabarire, ut’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ni we Mana y’Abisirayeli, ngw Eh’ azotuma kuzana Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babuloni umusavyi wiwe, na we azotereka intebe yiwe y’ubgami kur’ aya mabuye mpishije; kand’ azoshinga ihema ryiwe ry’ubgami kuri yo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
